                                    <a href="https://cannogacollege.ca/schools/business/finance" class="block px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:text-black hover:bg-neutral-100 rounded">Finance & Economics</a>
                                    <a href="https://cannogacollege.ca/schools/health-community/health-community-dept" class="block px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:text-black hover:bg-neutral-100 rounded">Health & Practical Nursing</a>
                                    <a href="https://cannogacollege.ca/schools/technology/energy-mechanical" class="block px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:text-black hover:bg-neutral-100 rounded">Mechanical Engineering</a>
